#api cal for list book
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/
Accept: application/json

#api cal for book creation
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"harry potter",
    "author":"jk rowling",
    "price":400,
    "pages":200,
    "publication":"bloomsburry"
}

#api cal for retrieve book details
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/1/
Accept: application/json

#api cal for delete book
###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/1/
Accept: application/json